msgid "Latest forum threads, plus the link's own children; hidden when empty."
msgstr "Nyeste forumtråde plus linkets egne underlinks; skjules, hvis der ikke er nogen."

#: src/Service/BiolandComponentRegistry.php
msgid "National target cards for GBF target 7, in tabs by country; always shown."
msgstr "Kort over nationale mål for GBF-mål 7, i faneblade pr. land; vises altid."

#: src/Service/BiolandComponentRegistry.php
msgid "One link per content type that has records, plus the link's own children; always shown."
msgstr "Ét link pr. indholdstype med poster plus linkets egne underlinks; vises altid."

